@startuml
' ============================================================================
' METADATA
'   author:       TheRobotDrafts Examples
'   description:  Three lifelines each with a state lane; events mark transitions and a duration constraint.
'   usecase:      Teach multi-lane timing, events between lifelines, duration constraints.
'   complexity:   medium
'   domain:       Network protocol handshake
' ============================================================================
title Example Timing Diagram - Medium Protocol Handshake

' Each participant gets its own state lane stacked against the shared time axis.
robust "Client" as C
robust "Server" as S
robust "Link"   as L

@0
C is "Idle"
S is "Listen"
L is "Down"

' An event (message) triggers a state transition in another lane.
@2
C is "Connecting"
@3
L is "Negotiating"
S is "SynRcvd"

@5
C is "Established"
S is "Established"
L is "Up"

' A duration constraint bounds the time between two observations.
@5 as :up
@5.5 as :ack
:up - :ack <= 500 ms

@12
C is "Closing"
S is "Closed"
L is "Down"

@enduml
